{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "fourth-quarter-anomalies",
  "title": "Q4 2025 Anomalies",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "d333cdb9-ea24-4140-9092-0670764e4c15",
      "question": "Using January 2 through September 30, 2025 as the baseline, which 15 sessions in the fourth quarter of 2025 were the most unusual among the 500 most liquid US stocks, and which features made each one unusual? Anomaly scores are neither forecasts nor explanations.",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:55:25.131438Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T18:55:42.138350Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**15 most unusual sessions in Q4 2025 among the 500 most liquid US stocks**\n(Baseline: Jan 2 – Sep 30, 2025)\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Date (close) | Anomaly score | Key feature deviations (robust z‑scores vs. baseline) |\n|------|--------|--------------|---------------|-------------------------------------------------------|\n| 1 | BWXT | 2025‑10‑03 | 14.38 | 1‑day return **+47.8σ**, 5‑day return **+18.3σ**, 20‑day vol **+15.7σ**, volume ~normal (+0.5σ) |\n| 2 | CRML | 2025‑10‑15 | 9.18 | 1‑day return **–13.6σ**, 5‑day return **+21.8σ**, 20‑day vol **+15.2σ**, volume **+1.3σ** |\n| 3 | CRML | 2025‑10‑14 | 7.56 | 1‑day return **+16.3σ**, 5‑day return **+46.2σ**, 20‑day vol **+14.0σ**, volume **+1.8σ** |\n| 4 | CAN | 2025‑10‑13 | 6.23 | 1‑day return **+22.7σ**, 5‑day return **+3.4σ**, 20‑day vol **+9.8σ**, volume **+1.0σ** |\n| 5 | CRML | 2025‑10‑24 | 5.27 | 1‑day return **+5.8σ**, 5‑day return **–6.6σ**, 20‑day vol **+16.6σ**, volume ~normal |\n| 6 | CAN | 2025‑10‑31 | 4.73 | 1‑day return **+8.1σ**, 5‑day return **–5.8σ**, 20‑day vol **+11.4σ**, volume **–0.9σ** |\n| 7 | BHVN | 2025‑11‑11 | 3.72 | 1‑day return **+4.7σ**, 5‑day return **–9.2σ**, 20‑day vol **+7.6σ**, volume **+0.8σ** |\n| 8 | CRML | 2025‑10‑07 | 3.69 | 1‑day return **–7.4σ**, 5‑day return **+14.2σ**, 20‑day vol **+8.7σ**, volume **+1.4σ** |\n| 9 | ASST | 2025‑10‑28 | 3.65 | 1‑day return **–6.6σ**, 5‑day return **+16.7σ**, 20‑day vol **+12.7σ**, volume **+2.1σ** |\n| 10 | CAN | 2025‑11‑18 | 3.52 | 1‑day return **+12.3σ**, 5‑day return **–1.5σ**, 20‑day vol **+7.8σ**, volume **+0.3σ** |\n| 11 | BHVN | 2025‑11‑06 | 3.38 | 1‑day return **+1.2σ**, 5‑day return **–11.9σ**, 20‑day vol **+7.7σ**, volume **+1.8σ** |\n| 12 | CRML | 2025‑10‑30 | 3.29 | 1‑day return **+6.6σ**, 5‑day return **–1.4σ**, 20‑day vol **+17.0σ**, volume ~normal |\n| 13 | CAN | 2025‑11‑05 | 3.21 | 1‑day return **+8.6σ**, 5‑day return **–1.6σ**, 20‑day vol **+12.2σ**, volume **–1.1σ** |\n| 14 | ACVA | 2025‑11‑10 | 3.02 | 1‑day return **+3.4σ**, 5‑day return **–9.5σ**, 20‑day vol **+6.5σ**, volume **+1.5σ** |\n| 15 | ASPI | 2025‑11‑07 | 2.98 | 1‑day return **+10.1σ**, 5‑day return **–2.3σ**, 20‑day vol **+7.8σ**, volume **+0.9σ** |\n\n**Features monitored** (all reported as robust z‑scores against the Jan 2 – Sep 30, 2025 baseline, not as returns or percentages):\n- `adjusted_return_1d` – one‑day adjusted close return\n- `adjusted_return_5d` – five‑day adjusted close return\n- `realized_volatility_20d` – 20‑day realized volatility\n- `log_volume_deviation_20d` – 20‑day log‑volume deviation\n\n**Limitations** (from the engine): anomaly scores describe unusual observed feature combinations; they are not forecasts or probabilities. Observed deviations are robust z‑scores against the training window and do not establish a cause or adverse event. [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — market anomaly scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:42ec9505a6a9b895832cbfe7c97c1a6a7cbabb503c36495126e91297e02d31e7`",
